Discount Calculator
Effective Date: March 21, 2026

Thank you for using "Discount Calculator" (hereinafter referred to as "the App"). We understand the importance of privacy and are committed to protecting your information transparently. The core design principle of this App is: All possible data is prioritized to be stored locally on your device.

1. How We Handle Your Information (Core Principle)
The core functionality of this App (calculating discounts) does not require nor collect any personally identifiable information (such as name, email address, device ID, etc.). To enhance your user experience, this App only saves the following two settings locally on your device:

- Theme Preference: Dark or Light Mode.
- Language Preference.

These settings are stored via a local database (Hive) and are used solely to restore your preferences each time you open the App. They are never sent to us or any external server.

2. Third-Party Advertising Services
To support the free operation of this App, we use ad mediation services that work with multiple advertising platforms. These platforms may collect and use data (such as device identifiers, approximate location based on IP address, and ad interaction data) to display ads.

Currently, the ad mediation may involve the following advertising partners:

- Google AdMob (Privacy policy: https://policies.google.com/privacy)
- OpenX (Privacy policy: https://www.openx.com/legal/privacy-policy/)
- PubMatic (Privacy policy: https://pubmatic.com/legal/privacy-policy/)
- Index Exchange (Privacy policy: https://www.indexexchange.com/privacy-policy/)

We do not control how these third-party platforms collect or process your data. We encourage you to review their privacy policies for full details.

3. Log Data
Anonymous advertising log data (such as ad impressions and clicks) may be generated and collected by the ad platforms listed above for ad delivery and analytical purposes. Beyond this, the App currently does not actively collect any diagnostic or usage logs.

4. Cookies & Similar Technologies
The App itself does not use traditional web browser cookies. However, the advertising platforms listed above may use advertising IDs or similar technologies for ad delivery. The local storage (Hive) within the App is used only for functional settings and does not have the ability to track you across apps or websites.

5. Data Security
Local Data: Your app preference settings are stored locally on the device. Their security is directly tied to the security of your device itself. We recommend you take common device security measures (such as setting a screen lock).

Advertising Data: For data processed by the advertising platforms, their security practices are governed by their respective privacy and security policies.

6. Links to Other Sites
The App may contain links to third-party websites (such as the developer's website). Please note that these sites are not under our control, and their content and privacy practices are not associated with us. Please review the privacy policies of any third-party sites before accessing them.

7. Children's Privacy
This App is not designed for children under the age of 13, and we do not knowingly collect any information from such users. Regarding advertising, each ad platform has its own policies concerning children.

8. Changes to This Privacy Policy
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The updated policy will be posted on this page, and the "Effective Date" will be revised accordingly. For significant changes, we will provide notice in the App's update notes. We advise you to review this page periodically for any changes.

